{"availability":"available","full":"Nikhil-creat/vitaforge-fullstack","name":"vitaforge-fullstack","description":"AI resume analyzer & builder: upload a resume, get an ATS score, and generate a one-page ATS-friendly DOCX/PDF. FastAPI + Groq agent, RAG, CNN-style layout scan, Docker. Designed & developed by NIKHIL CHARY SRIRAMOJU.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":4,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-10T00:33:01Z","updated":"2026-10-10T06:12:08Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://nikhil-creat.github.io/vitaforge-fullstack/","topics":["agentic-ai","ai","ats-resume","docker","fastapi","groq","javascript","nikhilcharysriramoju","pwa","python","rag","resume-analyzer","resume-builder"],"demo":"https://nikhil-creat.github.io/vitaforge-fullstack/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T18:52:43.121Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T18:52:43.121Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T18:52:43.121Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T14:53:03.924Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T18:52:43.121Z","stars":4,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Designed and developed by NIKHIL CHARY SRIRAMOJU","Upload a resume → ATS score + fix list → AI agent rewrites it into a one-page, ATS-safe resume. FastAPI backend calls Groq (free tier) so your API key stays on the server."],"features":["Quill-style UI (light/dark, animated hero, Docker demo), prefilled studio","Local ATS scoring (10-part rubric), live gauge, one-page auto-fit, export real DOCX (Word, validated), PDF (print to PDF), .txt, .html","Agent (/api/agent/run): diagnose → RAG retrieve → rewrite → critic → revise → guardrail. Any number the model invents is replaced with [X].","AI review, cover letter, tailor-to-job, LinkedIn, interview questions, mock-interview feedback (with voice dictation), streaming career chat","Server-side PDF/DOCX parsing; works offline with local templates if the API is down"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nik